{
  "about": "Red-team corpus for the safety guardrails. 'dev' includes the phrasings that the 2026-10-17 external audit found were missed or wrongly blocked; fixes are developed against it. 'heldout' was written on 2026-10-17 before the fixes, by the developer, and is never used to tune patterns. Expected values: emergency | help | dosing | injection | none (none = must not trigger emergency, help, dosing or injection). 'symptoms_dev' and 'symptoms_heldout' (added 2026-10-21 after the owner found that 'I am feeling weak' got no help response) cover how people describe feeling unwell: red-flag symptoms must trigger emergency; other symptoms must trigger at least help; questions about side effects must not trigger emergency. symptoms_heldout was written before the fix and is never used to tune patterns.",
